    "Dialogue": [
        {
            "Time": 0.0,
            "Dialogue": [
                {
                    "Text": "[patterns=\"1,2,4,5,6\"][auto=\"0\"]",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Time": 129.0,
            "Dialogue": [
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"][patterns=\"0\"]Oh look at that!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]You are still managing to stand on your own two feet after the first act!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]I have to admit I was expecting you to take your final bow of the performance by now",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Not that I thought you were incapable or anything, I simply didn’t realize we had such a fighter amongst us!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]A true survivor…",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]A persistent little RISING STAR on our hands tonight!!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Tell me DARLING…",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Are you enjoying the show tonight?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"you\"]…",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]OH!! Don’t be shy We have had such a lovely time together with all that jumping, dodging, and stumbling all about the stage",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]AND Isn’t it just PRECIOUS that you have started to get the hang of it?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]but… PERSONALLY DARLING…",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]I must admit this is all a little too choreographed for my taste",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]I was hoping for a little more FLAIR; A little more PASSION; I was hoping for some real IMPROVISATION on stage here tonight!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]and every great performer and every great performance of theirs comes with a little adversity and hardship, isn’t that right darling?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]After all, how could I possibly be a star without someone to dance around on stage?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"][patterns=\"1,2,4,5,6\"]PLACES AGAIN EVERYONE!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "Time": 273.0,
            "Dialogue": [
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"][patterns=\"0\"]A STAR IS BORN!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]BRAVO!!! BRAVISSIMO!!! WHAT A PERFORMANCE!!! WHAT A SPECTACLE!!! SOMEBODY GET THIS STAR A BOQUET! SOME FLOWERS FOR THEIR PERFORMANCE!!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]We have laughed! We have cried! We have danced and we have dodged! ",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]and you my rising star, have made it all the way to the end!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"][patterns=\"0\"]Don’t let it all go to your head, Streisand",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]There’s only room for ONE HEADLINER around here!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]OHHOHOHO HAHAHA",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Maybe I should start mixing stand up comedy into my future performances",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Do you think I have a knack for it, darling?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"you\"]…",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]Well!! It seems like we have a tough crowd tonight folks!",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"]I suppose it’s time for our final bow now,",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                },
                {
                    "Text": "[s=\"gloria\"][patterns=\"1,2,4,5,6\"]Shall we?",
                    "Audio": {
                        "instanceID": 0
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
